---
const personalImageAlt = "Isai Colina Senior Developer";
import me from "../assets/isaiSquare.jpg";
---

<article
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 md:flex-row"
>
  <img
    width="200"
    height="200"
    src={me.src}
    alt={personalImageAlt}
    class="order-1 object-cover w-64 h-full p-1 md:order-2 lg:p-2 lg:w-64 aspect-square rounded-2xl"
    style="object-position: 50% 50%"
  />
  <div
    class="[&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-cyan-500 dark:[&>p>strong]:text-cyan-200 text-pretty order-2"
  >
    <p>
      Hello, I'm Isai Colina. I am a technology professional with <strong>
        over 7 years of experience</strong
      > across full stack engineering, product execution, and technical leadership.
      My current focus is designing agentic AI systems that help teams make better
      decisions and operate with greater reliability.
    </p>
    <p>
      I work at the intersection of AI strategy, systems architecture, and delivery.
      I define decision boundaries, ownership models, and failure-handling patterns
      that make autonomous workflows observable, controllable, and production-ready.
    </p>

    <p>
      Beyond architecture, I lead teams and collaboration across engineering, product,
      and operations to align technical initiatives with measurable business impact.
      I enjoy mentoring, setting standards, and building environments where high
      quality execution can scale.
    </p>

    <p>
      As a graduate in Business Administration, I bring a practical perspective for
      connecting technology decisions with organizational goals. I am interested in
      leadership opportunities where AI, product strategy, and engineering can drive
      meaningful transformation.
    </p>
  </div>
</article>
